personal_workspace

This repository contains a customized derivative of AI Agent Station Study
v2.2 by fuzhengwei (xiaofuge). The upstream project metadata declares the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The upstream relationship and required dependency
attribution are documented in THIRD_PARTY.md.

The Personal AI Workspace additions include project-aware chunking and
retrieval, workspace memory, diff risk checks, PostgreSQL migration support,
deployment tuning, and the customized static frontend distribution.
